msgid "This is a logistics order"
msgstr "Questo è un ordine logistico"

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"This quotation has logistics charge codes on its lines. Disabling the "
"logistics flag will skip the credit / KYC / margin guards on confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Questo preventivo contiene codici di addebito logistici nelle sue righe. "
"Disabilitando il flag logistico verranno saltati i controlli di credito / "
"KYC / margine in fase di conferma."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_log_quotation.field_sale_order__eh_log_total_planned_cost
msgid "Total Planned Cost"
msgstr "Costo totale pianificato"

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/wizards/eh_log_quotation_preflight.py:0
msgid "Upload current KYC documents before confirming."
msgstr "Carica i documenti KYC attuali prima di confermare."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_quotation.selection__eh_log_quotation_preflight__overall_status__warning
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_quotation.selection__eh_log_quotation_preflight_line__status__warning
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_quotation.selection__sale_order__eh_log_credit_status__warning
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_quotation.selection__sale_order__eh_log_kyc_status__warning
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_log_quotation.selection__sale_order__eh_log_margin_status__warning
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Avviso"

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_quotation.field_sale_order_line__eh_log_is_disbursement
msgid ""
"When True, the line is treated as pass-through and excluded from gross "
"margin computation."
msgstr ""
"Quando è True, la riga viene trattata come partita di giro ed esclusa dal "
"calcolo del margine lordo."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_log_quotation.field_eh_log_charge_template_apply__replace_existing
msgid ""
"When checked, existing logistics charge lines (lines carrying a charge code)"
" are removed before the template lines are appended. Non-logistics product "
"lines are always preserved."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, le righe di addebito logistico esistenti (righe con un "
"codice di addebito) vengono rimosse prima di aggiungere le righe del "
"modello. Le righe di prodotto non logistiche vengono sempre conservate."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_log_quotation.field_eh_log_quotation_preflight_line__wizard_id
msgid "Wizard"
msgstr "Procedura guidata"

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-001] Only logistics managers can approve this quotation. Ask "
"your manager to take action."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-001] Solo i responsabili della logistica possono approvare "
"questo preventivo. Chiedi al tuo responsabile di intervenire."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/models/sale_order.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-002] This quotation does not currently require approval. The "
"Approve action is only available when the margin, credit, or KYC guard "
"surfaces a blocking reason."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-002] Questo preventivo attualmente non richiede approvazione. "
"L'azione Approva è disponibile solo quando il controllo di margine, credito "
"o KYC evidenzia un motivo bloccante."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/models/sale_order.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-003] Quotation %(name)s requires manager approval before confirmation. Reasons:\n"
"%(reasons)s\n"
"\n"
"Use the Approve action to record the decision, then confirm again."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-003] Il preventivo %(name)s richiede l'approvazione del responsabile prima della conferma. Motivi:\n"
"%(reasons)s\n"
"\n"
"Utilizza l'azione Approva per registrare la decisione, quindi conferma di nuovo."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/wizards/eh_log_mass_action_wizards.py:0
msgid "[EHL-APPROVAL-010] Only logistics managers may run mass-approve."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-APPROVAL-010] Solo i responsabili della logistica possono eseguire "
"l'approvazione di massa."

#. module: eh_log_quotation
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_quotation/wizards/eh_log_charge_template_apply.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"[EHL-TEMPLATE-001] Template %(name)s has no lines. Add lines to the template"
" first."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-TEMPLATE-001] Il modello %(name)s non ha righe. Aggiungi prima le righe"
" al modello."
